      "created_at": "2011-09-23T18:18:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;Adam&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"Adam\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>but we’re still talking about a place in which animal abuse is the cultural norm.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Animal abuse <span class=\"bbcode-i\">and</span> vagrancy. Why aren’t these kids in school? No wonder every person you see wants to fight you: the vast majority of the game world is populated by non-educated delinquents (NEDs).</p>",
